{"name":"Veltalar","status":"ok","title":"Veltalar","pageId":15636,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Veltalar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Velprintalar</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aglarond\" title=\"Aglarond\">Aglarond</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/East_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"East Faerûn\">East Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Metropolis</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>  </td><td> 51%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Half-elf\" title=\"Half-elf\">Half-elf</a>  </td><td> 40%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">Elf</a>  </td><td> 3%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halfling</a>  </td><td> 3%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">Dwarf</a>  </td><td> 1% </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Gnome\" title=\"Gnome\">Gnome</a> </td><td> 1% </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" title=\"Half-orc\">Half-orc</a> </td><td> 1% </td></tr></tbody></table> (1374 DR)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alignment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alignments</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"alignment-grid\" style=\"caption-side:top;\">  <tbody><tr>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_good\" title=\"Lawful good\">LG</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral_good\" title=\"Neutral good\">NG</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_good\" title=\"Chaotic good\">CG</a></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td class=\"alignment-on\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_neutral\" title=\"Lawful neutral\">LN</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-on\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral\" title=\"Neutral\">N</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-on\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_neutral\" title=\"Chaotic neutral\">CN</a></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_evil\" title=\"Lawful evil\">LE</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral_evil\" title=\"Neutral evil\">NE</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_evil\" title=\"Chaotic evil\">CE</a></td>  </tr></tbody></table> (1374 DR)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"government\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Simbarch Council (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2ltYmFyY2hfQ291bmNpbD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Simbarch Council</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">70,000<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p88_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Veltalar\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Veltalar\">Inhabitants of  Veltalar</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Veltalar\" title=\"Category:Locations in Veltalar\">Locations in  Veltalar</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Veltalar\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Veltalar\">Organizations in  Veltalar</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Veltalar</b> (formerly <b>Velprintalar</b>) was a settlement in <a href=\"/wiki/Aglarond\" title=\"Aglarond\">Aglarond</a> and the nation's primary port in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a>, with a population of around seventy thousand.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p88_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was founded by <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> colonists from <a href=\"/wiki/Chessenta\" title=\"Chessenta\">Chessenta</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/756_DR\" title=\"756 DR\">756 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p47_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p47-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The population of Veltalar rose from around 35,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1368_DR\" title=\"1368 DR\">1368 DR</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p65_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p65-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> to around 66,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1374_DR\" title=\"1374 DR\">1374 DR</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p111_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p111-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> then around 70,000 by 1479 DR.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p88_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The city did not have defensive walls.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p65_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p65-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Port\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Port</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Old_Velprintalar\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Old Velprintalar</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Militia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Militia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Important_Sites\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Important Sites</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Old_Velprintalar_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Old Velprintalar</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Palace_of_the_Simbul\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Palace of the Simbul</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Rose_Keep\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rose Keep</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Early_history\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Early history</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Velprintalar_and_Veltalar\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Velprintalar and Veltalar</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Subsidence_of_the_sea\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Subsidence of the sea</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Adventures\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Adventures</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Novels_&_Short_Stories\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Organized_Play_&_Licensed_Adventures\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Organized Play &amp; Licensed Adventures</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Port\">Port</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Port\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Port\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n\n<p>As of 1368 DR, the city docks were equipped with cargo cranes and a limited drydock. The waterfront featured numerous small warehouses for this cargo. <a href=\"/wiki/Nytus_the_Shipwright\" title=\"Nytus the Shipwright\">Nytus the Shipwright</a> was a sailor who retired and made a name as a shipwright.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p65_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p65-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In <a href=\"/wiki/1374_DR\" title=\"1374 DR\">1374 DR</a>, Velprintalar was the only major port in Aglarond, with a large naval yard. It received trade via ship from <a href=\"/wiki/Impiltur\" title=\"Impiltur\">Impiltur</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sembia\" title=\"Sembia\">Sembia</a>. After peace had been established with <a href=\"/wiki/Thay\" title=\"Thay\">Thay</a>, Aglarond prospered, boosting trade in the city.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p111_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p111-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Old_Velprintalar\">Old Velprintalar</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Old Velprintalar\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Old Velprintalar\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of 1479 DR, the city moved towards the receded shoreline in relation to its previous location. The old city was renamed Old Velprintalar and became a slum.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p88_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The settled land furthest away from the shore was on a steep slope, and the buildings were placed close together as a result. As stories of differing architectural styles were added, a patchwork appearance developed in this part of the city.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p111_4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p111-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Militia\">Militia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Militia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Militia\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of <a href=\"/wiki/1368_DR\" title=\"1368 DR\">1368 DR</a>, the city contained a barracks, <a href=\"/wiki/Griffonheight_Keep\" title=\"Griffonheight Keep\">Griffonheight Keep</a>, at which were stationed 250 foot soldiers and 50 cavalry under the command of Sir <a href=\"/wiki/Tyman\" title=\"Tyman\">Tyman</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Half-elf\" title=\"Half-elf\">half-elf</a>. By <a href=\"/wiki/1374_DR\" title=\"1374 DR\">1374 DR</a>, the number of foot soldiers had increased to 400, and the cavalry were replaced by aerial cavalry.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p67_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p67-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p112_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p112-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Important_Sites\">Important Sites</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Important Sites\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Important Sites\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Old_Velprintalar_2\">Old Velprintalar</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Old Velprintalar\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Old Velprintalar\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Amongst the notable locations in Velprintalar as of 1368 DR were the <a href=\"/wiki/Harbor_Light\" title=\"Harbor Light\">Harbor Light</a>, a stone lighthouse containing a magical fire; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Paladin_Inn\" title=\"The Paladin Inn\">The Paladin Inn</a>, catering for the wealthier visitors to the city; the more modest inn <a href=\"/wiki/The_Sailor%27s_Home\" title=\"The Sailor's Home\">The Sailor's Home</a>; and the <a href=\"/wiki/Council_Hall\" title=\"Council Hall\">Council Hall</a> where the advisory council to the Simbul met.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p65-66_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p65-66-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>During the same period, the city also contained a temple to <a href=\"/wiki/Chauntea\" title=\"Chauntea\">Chauntea</a> called the <a href=\"/wiki/Green_Lady%27s_Keep\" title=\"Green Lady's Keep\">Green Lady's Keep</a>, a white-domed temple to <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a> called the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_the_Four_Moons\" title=\"House of the Four Moons\">House of the Four Moons</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p66-67_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p66-67-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p111_4-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p111-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> as well as the largest library dedicated to <a href=\"/wiki/Truename\" title=\"Truename\">truename</a> magic, the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_the_Unnamed\" title=\"House of the Unnamed\">House of the Unnamed</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-CC-Truenamers_9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-CC-Truenamers-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>A marketplace existed where farmers exchanged goods like grain, fruits and vegetables with foreign traders and merchants.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p66-67_8-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p66-67-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Palace_of_the_Simbul\">Palace of the Simbul</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Palace of the Simbul\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Palace of the Simbul\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Palace_of_the_Simbul\" title=\"Palace of the Simbul\">Palace of the Simbul</a> was where <a href=\"/wiki/Aglarond\" title=\"Aglarond\">Aglarond</a>'s then ruler, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Simbul\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Simbul\">the Simbul</a>, resided between <a href=\"/wiki/1320_DR\" title=\"1320 DR\">1320 DR</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/1425_DR\" title=\"1425 DR\">1425 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p66_10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p66-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> From 1425 DR onwards, it was used by the <a href=\"/wiki/Simbarch_of_Aglarond\" title=\"Simbarch of Aglarond\">Simbarch Council</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p88_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rose_Keep\">Rose Keep</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Rose Keep\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Rose Keep\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Keep\" title=\"Rose Keep\">Rose Keep</a> was a trade enclave on the edge of town.<sup id=\"cite_ref-CoT-p71_11-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-CoT-p71-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Early_history\">Early history</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Early history\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Early history\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Then called Velprin, the site of the city was the seat of power for the human kings of the time.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p111_4-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p111-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Velprintalar_and_Veltalar\">Velprintalar and Veltalar</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Velprintalar and Veltalar\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=10\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Velprintalar and Veltalar\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The settlement was named Velprintalar during the reign of King <a href=\"/wiki/Brindor_Ol%C3%B3synne\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Brindor Olósynne\">Brindor Olósynne</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p111_4-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p111-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and then renamed Veltalar some time between 1374 DR and 1479 DR.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p88_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Subsidence_of_the_sea\">Subsidence of the sea</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Subsidence of the sea\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=11\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Subsidence of the sea\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Late in the 14th century <a href=\"/wiki/Dale_reckoning\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dale reckoning\">DR</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_of_Fallen_Stars\" title=\"Sea of Fallen Stars\">Sea of Fallen Stars</a> subsided, causing the coastline on which Veltalar lay to retreat. New developments moved closer to the new shoreline, while the existing city slipped into disrepair and slums, becoming known as Old Velprintalar.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p88_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=12\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=13\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Gallery\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"51ab1b9e65962c767fcca48fa32ed31b\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><i>A map of <a href=\"/wiki/Aglarond\" title=\"Aglarond\">Aglarond</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a> years.</i></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Veltalar?veaction=edit&section=14\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"block-indent\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Adventures\">Adventures</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"></div><div class=\"block-indent\"><b><small>Referenced only</small></b><br><small><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Twilight_Tomb\" title=\"The Twilight Tomb\">The Twilight Tomb</a></i></small></div><h4><span id=\"Novels_.26_Short_Stories\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Novels_&_Short_Stories\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Silverfall\" title=\"Silverfall\">Silverfall</a></i>: <a href=\"/wiki/Silverfall/Wizard_Hunting_Season\" title=\"Silverfall/Wizard Hunting Season\">\"Wizard Hunting Season\"</a>&#160;• <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Simbul%27s_Gift\" title=\"The Simbul's Gift\">The Simbul's Gift</a></i>&#160;• <i><a href=\"/wiki/City_of_Torment\" title=\"City of Torment\">City of Torment</a></i></div><div class=\"block-indent\"><b><small>Referenced only</small></b><br><small><i><a href=\"/wiki/Mistress_of_the_Night\" title=\"Mistress of the Night\">Mistress of the Night</a></i>&#160;• <i><a href=\"/wiki/Key_of_Stars_(novel)\" title=\"Key of Stars (novel)\">Key of Stars</a></i></small></div><h4><span id=\"Organized_Play_.26_Licensed_Adventures\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Organized_Play_&_Licensed_Adventures\">Organized Play &amp; Licensed Adventures</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/At_the_Foot_of_the_Lighthouse\" title=\"At the Foot of the Lighthouse\">At the Foot of the Lighthouse</a></i>&#160;• <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Worst_of_All_Snares\" title=\"The Worst of All Snares\">The Worst of All Snares</a></i>&#160;• <i><a href=\"/wiki/Through_Twilight_Boughs\" title=\"Through Twilight Boughs\">Through Twilight Boughs</a></i></div><div class=\"block-indent\"><b><small>Referenced only</small></b><br><small><i><a href=\"/wiki/Lost_Temple_of_the_Fey_Gods\" title=\"Lost Temple of the Fey Gods\">Lost Temple of the Fey Gods</a></i></small></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgot